      "hardware_label": "RTX 3090",
      "notes": "Lenovo ThinkStation P620 (TR Pro 5955WX, 64 GB DDR4-3200 ECC), 2x RTX 3090 (1x Gigabyte Waterforce Xtreme 3090 Ti + 1x NVIDIA Founders Edition 3090), both PCIe Gen4 x16, both 250 W power cap, ReBAR enabled (BAR1 32 GB each), no NVLink, layer-split via -sm layer (auto). Engine: am17an/llama.cpp mtp-clean branch (PR #22673, build b1-ebe4fca). Model: unsloth/Qwen3.6-27B-MTP-GGUF Q8_0 + spliced 15-tensor NeXTN MTP head. MTP n=3 acceptance ~97.5% on this bench (5949/6307 drafts accepted aggregated over the 20-prompt run; max_output_tokens/s 84.0). KV cache f16, no quant. Methodology: vllm bench serve, random 512in/512out, 20 prompts, max-concurrency 1, --save-result. Comparison context: same model class on a near-identical card set (3090 Ti + 3090) ran on the workstation pre-migration as vLLM FP8 (44.17 t/s) and llama.cpp Q8 no-spec (19.22 t/s) in the 2026-04-26 leaderboard batch.",
